# crush-forensics
===
 Open-source desktop workbench for digital forensic analysis. Inspect ZIP/TAR/7z/UFDR archives, raw disk images/EWF, and iTunes/Android backups. Parse and view ABX, SQLite, SEGB, (B)PLIST, REALM, Protobuf, MMKV, Logs, hex, JSON, XML, images, audio/video, PDF, and more — all in one GUI.
